  "summary": "Malicious code in melbet-cm (npm)",
  "details": "Melbet-cm@1.0.0 ships no functional code: its entry point is an empty module (module.exports = {}) and it contains no install scripts, executables, or dependencies. The package consists solely of a French-language SEO article promoting the Melbet online-gambling site, linking to 1monde2sport[.]com and embedding an image from i[.]ibb[.]co. It is an SEO/spam package with no executable payload; the analysis is metadata-only as no code artifacts are present to inspect.",
